  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold or are exposed to racist ideologies, particularly those who believe in or propagate anti-Black stereotypes associating Black people with criminality and incarceration. The meme is designed to appeal to or reinforce these views by mocking the Black Lives Matter movement through the juxtaposition of Black men in prison uniforms with the phrase 'black lives matter' and a sarcastic comment questioning its relevance. The intended audience likely includes people who are skeptical of or hostile toward the Black Lives Matter movement, and who may find humor or validation in racially charged tropes that devalue Black lives by linking them to prison imagery. This audience is drawn to the meme’s hateful intent and its use of harmful stereotypes, which serve to delegitimize the movement and reinforce systemic racism.",
